a0e:T903,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Which is the best Text to Speech AI model?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Eleven v4 Turbo currently leads the Text to Speech Arena with an Elo score of 1330."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the top Text to Speech models?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The top Text to Speech models by Elo rating are: 1. Eleven v4 Turbo (Elo 1330), 2. Eleven v4 (Elo 1328), 3. Qwen-Audio-3.1-TTS-Plus (Elo 1300), 4. Sonic 3.6 (Elo 1286), and 5. Gemini 3.8 Flash TTS (Elo 1274). Rankings are based on blind user votes in the Speech Arena."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How are Text to Speech models ranked on this leaderboard?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Models are ranked using an Elo rating system derived from user votes in blind comparisons in the Speech Arena. Users listen to pairs of speech samples generated from the same text and choose which sounds more natural. Higher Elo scores indicate a model produces speech preferred more often by listeners."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which Text to Speech model is the cheapest?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Kokoro 82M v1.0 is the most affordable at $0.65 per 1M characters with an Elo score of 1063. Other affordable options include StyleTTS 2 at $2.82 per 1M characters."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which is the best open weights Text to Speech model?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Fish Audio Drama 3 Preview is the highest-ranked open weights model on the Text to Speech Leaderboard with an Elo score of 1243. There are 17 open weights models out of 97 total."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the top 5 open weights Text to Speech models?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The top 5 open weights Text to Speech models are: 1. Fish Audio Drama 3 Preview (Elo 1243), 2. Breeze TTS 2 (Elo 1221), 3. Fish Audio S2 Pro (Elo 1118), 4. Step Audio EditX (Mar 2026) (Elo 1097), and 5. Voxtral TTS (Elo 1088)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What categories and accents can I filter by?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can filter by the following categories: Knowledge Sharing, Assistants, Entertainment, and Customer Service, and the following accents: US and UK."}}]}a09:["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$a0e"}}]
